       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. DEBUGSPK.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 WS-CUSTOMER-ID PIC X(10).
       01 WS-BALANCE PIC 9(5)V99 COMP-3.
       01 WS-COUNTER PIC S9(4) COMP.
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
       MAIN-PARA.
           MOVE "CUST00001" TO WS-CUSTOMER-ID.
           MOVE 123.45 TO WS-BALANCE.
           MOVE 0 TO WS-COUNTER.
           PERFORM VARYING WS-COUNTER FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-COUNTER > 3
               DISPLAY "LOOP ITER " WS-COUNTER
               PERFORM CALC-INTEREST
           END-PERFORM.
           DISPLAY "FINAL BALANCE " WS-BALANCE.
           STOP RUN.
       CALC-INTEREST.
           ADD 1 TO WS-BALANCE.
